{"title":"Install on Kubernetes","description":"Install Stirling PDF on Kubernetes with the official Helm chart, keep its data on a persistent volume and upgrade it.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"server\" href=\"/Server/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>Self-hosted server</span></a>\n    <h1>Install on Kubernetes</h1>\n<p>Install Stirling PDF with the official Helm chart:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://stirling-tools.github.io/Stirling-PDF-chart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf/stirling-pdf-chart</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --create-namespace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> values.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"valuesyaml\" class=\"anchor-heading\">values.yaml<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#valuesyaml\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Put your overrides in <code>values.yaml</code>. The chart's <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF-chart/blob/main/charts/stirling-pdf/values.yaml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">default values.yaml</a> lists every option with comments, and its <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF-chart/tree/main/charts/stirling-pdf/examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">examples</a> cover a single node and a cluster.</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3.2.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">persistence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">8Gi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">envs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SYSTEM_DEFAULTLOCALE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">en-GB</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>image.tag:</strong> pins the Stirling PDF version. Left empty, the chart's own version is used. For the fat or ultra-lite image, see <a href=\"/Server/Install/Docker/#choose-an-image\">Choose an image</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>persistence:</strong> Stirling PDF keeps users, <code>settings.yml</code> and its built-in database in <code>/configs</code>. Enabling persistence mounts a volume there, and the chart keeps files users save on the server in <code>/configs/storage</code> on the same volume. Without it they are lost when the pod restarts.</li>\n<li><strong>resources:</strong> always set a memory limit. We recommend 2 or more CPUs and 8 GB or more for production (see <a href=\"/Server/Operations/Performance/#sizing\">Sizing</a>).</li>\n<li><strong>envs:</strong> any setting can be passed as an environment variable. See <a href=\"/Server/Configuration/\">Configuration</a> for the naming rule.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For a sub-path, set the chart's <code>rootPath</code> option. The chart can also create an <code>ingress</code> or a Gateway API <code>httpRoute</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"change-settings\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Change settings<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#change-settings\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li>Set any setting from <code>settings.yml</code> as an environment variable in <code>envs</code>. See <a href=\"/Server/Configuration/\">Configuration</a> for the naming rule.</li>\n<li>Keep secrets, such as an SSO client secret, in a Kubernetes Secret and read them with <code>valueFrom</code>, or load a whole Secret with <code>envsFrom</code>.</li>\n<li>Apply changes with <code>helm upgrade</code> (see <a href=\"#upgrade\">Upgrade</a>). The pods restart with the new settings.</li>\n<li>With one pod and <code>persistence</code> on, the admin UI also works. With several pods, use <code>envs</code> only.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For example, Google sign-in (see <a href=\"/Server/Security/OAuth-SSO/\">OAuth2 / OIDC single sign-on</a> and <a href=\"/Server/Security/SAML-SSO/\">SAML single sign-on</a> for other providers):</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> generic</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-sso</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --from-literal=client-secret=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">client-secret</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">envs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SECURITY_OAUTH2_ENABLED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SECURITY_OAUTH2_CLIENT_GOOGLE_CLIENTID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;client-id></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SECURITY_OAUTH2_CLIENT_GOOGLE_CLIENTSECRET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    valueFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      secretKeyRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stirling-sso</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">client-secret</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"clustering\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Clustering<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#clustering\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Run several pods behind one service. The chart does not install PostgreSQL, Valkey or S3: bring your own.</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-create-the-secrets\" class=\"anchor-heading\">1. Create the Secrets<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#1-create-the-secrets\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><p>Each <code>existingSecret</code> value below names a Kubernetes Secret holding a password or key:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> generic</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-licence</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --from-literal=premium-key=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">licence-key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> generic</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-db</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --from-literal=password=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">database-password</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> generic</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-valkey</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --from-literal=password=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valkey-password</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> generic</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-s3</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --from-literal=access-key=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">access-key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --from-literal=secret-key=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">secret-key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>If Valkey has no password, skip <code>stirling-valkey</code> and its <code>existingSecret</code> line below.</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-valuesyaml\" class=\"anchor-heading\">2. values.yaml<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#2-valuesyaml\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">replicaCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cluster</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">premium</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  existingSecret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stirling-licence</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">externalDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres.example.internal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  existingSecret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stirling-db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">externalValkey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">valkey.example.internal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  existingSecret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stirling-valkey</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">externalS3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  bucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stirling-pdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  region</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">us-east-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  existingSecret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stirling-s3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">8Gi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">8Gi</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Install it with the <code>helm install</code> command at the top of this page.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Autoscaling:</strong> replace <code>replicaCount</code> with <code>autoscaling.enabled: true</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>PostgreSQL:</strong> the database and user default to <code>stirling</code>. For options such as <code>?sslmode=require</code>, set <code>externalDatabase.jdbcUrl</code> instead of <code>host</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Valkey TLS:</strong> set <code>externalValkey.tls: true</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>S3 on AWS:</strong> remove <code>existingSecret</code> to use the pod's IAM role (IRSA).</li>\n<li><strong>MinIO, SeaweedFS or another in-cluster S3:</strong> also set <code>endpoint</code>, <code>pathStyleAccess: true</code> and <code>allowPrivateEndpoints: true</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"what-each-part-is-for\" class=\"anchor-heading\">What each part is for<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#what-each-part-is-for\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Licence:</strong> Team or Enterprise, required for cluster mode.</li>\n<li><strong>PostgreSQL:</strong> users, teams, settings and job records shared by every pod.</li>\n<li><strong>Valkey or Redis:</strong> coordinates the pods: locks, the list of running pods, which pod owns each job, and rate limits. Run it with <code>maxmemory-policy noeviction</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>S3:</strong> short-lived job files any pod can serve, and files users save on the server.</li>\n<li><strong>Shared keys:</strong> the encryption keys every pod shares. The chart generates them once and keeps them in the <code>stirling-pdf-stirling-pdf-chart-keys</code> Secret.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"before-going-live\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Before going live<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#before-going-live\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><ul>\n<li>Add an S3 lifecycle rule that deletes objects under <code>transient/</code> only, after a day.</li>\n<li>The chart turns on sticky sessions for Traefik and ingress-nginx. For any other load balancer or Gateway, turn on cookie-based session affinity yourself.</li>\n<li>Back up the <code>stirling-pdf-stirling-pdf-chart-keys</code> Secret. For <code>helm template</code> or GitOps, create your own with the keys <code>credential-encryption-key</code> (<code>openssl rand -base64 32</code>), <code>automatically-generated-key</code> and <code>automatically-generated-uuid</code> (any UUIDs), and set <code>sharedKeys.existingSecret</code>.</li>\n<li>Change settings through <code>envs</code>. See <a href=\"#change-settings\">Change settings</a>.</li>\n<li>Leave <code>persistence</code> off.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"upgrade\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Upgrade<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#upgrade\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Change <code>image.tag</code> in <code>values.yaml</code> to the new version, then run:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upgrade</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf/stirling-pdf-chart</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> values.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<details>\n<summary>Upgrading from chart 3.x</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>Pass your values file with <code>-f</code>, or use <code>--reset-then-reuse-values</code>. <code>--reuse-values</code> fails.</li>\n<li>Chart 4 mounts the volume at <code>/configs</code> itself. If your <code>values.yaml</code> mounts <code>storage-volume</code> at <code>/configs</code> and <code>/storage</code> with <code>deployment.extraVolumeMounts</code>, keep those mounts and add this to <code>envs</code>:</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">envs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">STORAGE_LOCAL_BASEPATH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/storage</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Upgrading when you use the latest tag</summary>\n<p>Set <code>image.pullPolicy: Always</code> in <code>values.yaml</code>, apply it with the command above, then restart the pod to upgrade:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/stirling-pdf-stirling-pdf-chart</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</details>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Server/Install/Kubernetes.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#valuesyaml\">values.yaml</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#change-settings\">Change settings</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#clustering\">Clustering</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l3\"><a href=\"#1-create-the-secrets\">1. Create the Secrets</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l3\"><a href=\"#2-valuesyaml\">2. values.yaml</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l3\"><a href=\"#what-each-part-is-for\">What each part is for</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l3\"><a href=\"#before-going-live\">Before going live</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#upgrade\">Upgrade</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/Server/Install/Docker/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Docker</span>\n      </a><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Server/Install/JAR/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Bare bones (JAR)</span>\n      </a>"}